# deml-ui — Cursor rules

This repo is the DEML design system: **new-from-the-start (warm ash)**.

## LOCKED STYLE — MANDATORY EVERYWHERE

Warm ash NFTS is the **only** allowed look. **Any deviation is forbidden.**
Do not invent parallel palettes, type stacks, or chart contracts.

## Look (mandatory)

- Warm ash grounds (`#35312D` / `#1C1916`), cream modules (`#F3F0EA`), primary `#2F5F8F`,
  accents `#3F6B54` / `#9E3D47`; light ground `#D4CEC5`; muted `#C6C0B7` / `#4A453F`
- **Geist only** — mark 0.28em / intro 0.1em / display 800 + mobile-first clamp;
  body leading 1.62 + 60ch measure. No Syne/Fraunces. No brand or place names in code.
- Strict 8px grid (no half-steps), dual `data-theme`, equal `--tile-gap`, fluid
  dash-rows (`minmax(--tile-row-unit, auto|1fr)` — never ragged `min-content` rows)
- Equal outer `--module-pad` on every card / panel / box side
- Charts **LOCKED (absolute)**: `--chart-height-spark: 144px` / `--chart-height-panel: 280px`,
  width `100%`, equal `--chart-inset` / `--chart-inset-spark`, `--chart-stage-ink` —
  never squash/stretch/oversize/undersize, data-driven height, aspect-driven plots,
  or theme-invert series. See `docs/CHARTS.md`.
- Sharp modules (`--radius-*: 0`) unless a control needs the pill radius
- Solid opaque navbar; no page horizontal overflow from scaffolding
- Tokens only — no invented px/rem for spacing, color, type, elevation, or motion

## Do

- Change visuals in `components/<name>/` and `styles/tokens.css` / `styles/base.css`
- Expand from this warm-ash NFTS system only
- Expand Storybook kits in `scripts/lib/story-kits.mjs` when adding components
- Run `npm run sync` after adding/removing component folders; `npm run check:stories`; `npm run build` before release
- Prefer WCAG 2.0 AA patterns already used in base + headless primitives
- No component ships without CSF stories + a11y meta + Chromatic light/dark modes

## Do not (forbidden)

- Deviate from NFTS for experiments, atelier frankensteins, or cold seven-color locks
- Reintroduce Viking-UI naming, void-black / electric `#2176ff`, or `--viking-*` tokens
- Replace warm ash with arbitrary seven-color locks (`#0066B2` / void page chrome /
  `#FFFFFF` suite). `#121212` is allowed **only** as `--color-plot-stage` /
  `--chart-stage-ink` for activity-graph plot stages
- Hand-edit generated wrappers under `src/angular/markup/` or `generated/` — regenerate via sync
- Use fixed `grid-auto-rows: var(--dash-row)` without `minmax(..., auto)` (squashes charts/tiles)
- Invent one-off spacing outside the token scale

## Automated enforcement (no escape hatches)

`scripts/check_nfts_style.mjs` (`npm run check:nfts`) **fails** on missing NFTS
palette / `--chart-height-spark: 144px` / `--chart-height-panel: 280px` / Geist,
`--space-half`, hairline-as-gap, non-8px spacing px, ragged `min-content` rows,
fixed-only `grid-auto-rows`, Viking / `#2176ff`, and aspect-driven line charts.
`npm run check:stories` **fails** if any HTML component lacks a multi-story CSF
file with Chromatic + a11y meta. CI + Chromatic enforce both. **No escape hatches.**

Consumer guidance: deml `THEME.md` / `AGENTS.md`.
